  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods and Gender Empowerment in Post Conflict Areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will uplift quality of life of resettled people in 4 northern districts, mostly women. War widows will be trained for new life skills, secured entitlements to land, shelter and other rights and regain their livelihoods in agriculture and entry to the job market. and children are vulnerable, and the project addresses gender-based violence, inequality, child rights and links up with relevant government authorities. Most activities will be done with government partners.</narrative>
  </description>
